JDBC (Java Database Connectivity) - Way of connecting java application to Database.

                   To connect Database with java application we need
                   1. JDBC URL - jdbc:postgresql://localhost:8080/postgres -- Database name
                                         |              |       | -- Port
                                  Database type     Running on your own computer
                   2. DB User name
                   3. DB password
                   4. query

Syntax -
               Connection connection = DriverManager.getConnection(url , user, password)
               Statement statement = connection.createStatement();
               ResultSet resultSet = statement.executeQuery(query);


